    "  Q             - Use a survival item (food/medical)\n"
    "  UP/DOWN       - Navigate recipes / inventory / help pages\n"
    "  Enter         - Craft selected / confirm\n"
    "  J             - Toggle journal\n"
    "  H             - Toggle this help screen\n"
    "\n"
    "Display:\n"
    "  F11           - Toggle fullscreen\n"
    "\n"
    "Info:\n"
    "  ESC           - Release mouse grab (or quit if already released)\n"
    "  Ctrl+Q        - Quit game\n"
    "\n"
    "Survival:\n"
    "  Stamina (blue bar) drains while sprinting.\n"
    "  Cannot sprint below 20% stamina; walking slowly drains at low stamina.\n"
    "  Emus and kangaroos may attack if you get too close.\n"
